abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin bundling the /methodology-toolkit:method slash command,
  an auto-triggering methodology-driven-thinking skill with an evidence-gated
  product-research mode, red-team-critic and evidence-scout subagents and
  a hook that checks their reports, over a shared index of 33 analytical frameworks. The design enforces
  that methods are applied explicitly (every step walked through) rather than
  named, with verify-before-assert discipline and deliberate adversarial
  double-pass review.
